:: Pirate Attack Scum End 5
<<effects>><<npc "Zephyr">><<person1>>

You board the ship, eager to conceal your share of the spoils, when Zephyr's voice stops you in your tracks. "Hey, <<lass>>! Come over here, I've got something for you!"
<br><br>
<<He>> leads you into <<his>> quarters. The room smells of salt, old wood, and strong drink, with charts pinned to the walls and stolen trinkets crowded onto every shelf. After closing the door, Zephyr hands you a cup of strong, dark liquor.
<br><br>
"You did a fine job out there, <<lass>>. Good to have a mate like you on my crew," <<he>> says, <<his>> grin as wide as the sea.
<br><br>
<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
	<span class="blue">아이를 배고 있다는 걸 아는 상태로는 차마 마실 수 없다.</span>
<<else>>
	<<link [[술을 받는다|Pirate Attack Scum End 6]]>><<drunk 200>><<set $pirate_drink_dolp to 1>><</link>><<ggdrunk>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[술을 거절한다|Pirate Attack Scum End 6]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pirate Attack Scum End 6
<<effects>><<set $time to 2000>>
<<if $pirate_drink_dolp is 1>>
	You accept the drink. The liquor burns its way down your throat. <<He>> laughs, clinks <<his>> cup against yours, and takes a deep swig from <<his>> own.
	<br><br>
	"Here's to a successful raid!" <<he>> toasts, then pours another round before the first has settled.
<<else>>
	You decline the drink. <<He>> shrugs, finishes <<his>> cup in one gulp, and wipes <<his>> mouth with the back of <<his>> hand.
	<br><br>
	"More for me then!" <<he>> says, already pouring again.
<</if>>
<br><br>
The drink makes Zephyr louder. <<He>> raises <<his>> cup and starts retelling old raids, each one bloodier and grander than the last. "You wouldn't believe the trouble we got into a few months ago!" <<he>> says.
<br><br>
<<set $pirate_drink_dolp to 0>>
<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
