:: Pirate Attack Scum End 7
<<effects>>
<<if $pirate_drink_dolp is 1>>
	You accept the drink. It goes down easier than the first. Zephyr pours <<himself>> a generous amount, then leans closer. "Ya know," <<he>> says, "we once fought off a navy ship just for one chest of gold!"
	<br><br>
	The story grows less believable with every sentence. <<His>> speech grows thicker with every drink.
<<else>>
	You decline the drink. Zephyr takes another swig, undeterred. "You're missing out," <<he>> says, <<his>> grin turning loose and crooked. "But that just means more for me!"
<</if>>
<br><br>
Zephyr keeps drinking. <<His>> hand brushes yours more often than it needs to, and <<his>> gaze lingers longer each time. "Ya should've seen how we made a mess!" <<he>> laughs, though <<he>> seems more interested in you than the story.
<br><br>
